-- in LibItemDB's stat keys; credit: HawsJon / Pawn / Vger. Read-only "hawsjon"
-- provider — players add their own scales via LoadBiSWeights.
-- DPS_OFFHAND is DPS_MAINHAND x 0.5, the engine's base off-hand damage
-- multiplier -- the source publishes ONE melee-DPS weight. UNTALENTED: Dual
-- Wield Specialization raises it to 62.5-75%, and these scales model no talents.
--
