-- per-weapon-skill weights as inapplicable here, and there are none -- this
-- scale has no WEAPON_SKILL_* key at all. Weapon skill is priced by a rule in
-- Scoring/Vanilla.lua from the ITEM's +N skill, not by a weight in this file.
-- A starting scale, not an authority; LoadBiSWeights layers your own over it.
--
